{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "label": "ADR-013 \u2014 Modelo do MPC: matriz SOPDT + processo integrador; horizontes derivados do TSS", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_matriz_sopdt", "label": "Matriz de modelos SOPDT por par", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O formul\u00e1rio sem c\u00f3digo (ADR-008) exige forma param\u00e9trica fixa; modelos v\u00eam de step-test \u2192 matriz de modelos por par MV\u2192CV e DV\u2192CV; CV autorregul\u00e1vel \u2192 par\u00e2metros SOPDT (K, \u03c41, \u03c42, \u03b8) por par. Convers\u00e3o interna para espa\u00e7o de estados discreto do do-mpc; tempo morto via aumento de estados."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_modelo_integrador", "label": "Modelo integrador por par (Ki + \u03b8)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Processos de n\u00edvel/press\u00e3o em vaso fechado s\u00e3o integradores (PV n\u00e3o estabiliza) \u2192 par\u00e2metros de modelo integrador por par: ganho de rampa Ki [un/un\u00b7s] + tempo morto \u03b8. Integrador sem restri\u00e7\u00e3o de CV \u00e9 malha aberta inst\u00e1vel no \u00f3timo \u2192 valida\u00e7\u00e3o do formul\u00e1rio deve exigir limites/SP coerentes."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_horizontes_derivados_tss", "label": "Horizontes Np/Nc derivados do TSS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Np/Nc N\u00c3O s\u00e3o editados pelo usu\u00e1rio: derivados do TSS (Time to Steady State) informado por CV. Heur\u00edstica default: Ts_mpc = multiplicador \u00d7 Ts_flow; Np = ceil(TSS / Ts_mpc) com teto de seguran\u00e7a; Nc = max(2, ceil(Np/4)). Menos bot\u00f5es, defaults seguros: TSS \u00e9 um n\u00famero que engenheiro de processo sabe estimar; horizontes errados deixam de ser um modo de falha."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_limites_mv_rate_limit", "label": "Limites duros de MV e rate limit (\u0394u)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O formul\u00e1rio exp\u00f5e limites duros de MV (min/max) e rate limit (\u0394u m\u00e1x/ciclo)."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_matriz_sopdt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_modelo_integrador", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_horizontes_derivados_tss", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_limites_mv_rate_limit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_008_mpc_config_formulario_abas_adr", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_horizontes_derivados_tss", "target": "docs_adr_adr_014_orcamento_solver_multiplicador_multiplicador_execucao_mpc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_limites_mv_rate_limit", "target": "docs_adr_adr_008_mpc_config_formulario_abas_formulario_mpc_abas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "subsistema_mpc_config_execucao", "label": "Subsistema MPC: formul\u00e1rio de configura\u00e7\u00e3o, modelo SOPDT/integrador, or\u00e7amento de solver, categorias de vari\u00e1veis e simula\u00e7\u00e3o TFS", "nodes": ["docs_adr_adr_008_mpc_config_formulario_abas_formulario_mpc_abas", "docs_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_matriz_sopdt", "docs_adr_adr_014_orcamento_solver_multiplicador_timeout_solver_70pct", "docs_adr_adr_014_orcamento_solver_multiplicador_multiplicador_execucao_mpc", "docs_adr_adr_019_cv_sp_restricoes_por_faixa_precedencia_categorias_variaveis_mpc", "docs_adr_adr_022_bloco_tfs_simulacao_bloco_tfs"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85